   prompt| Workspace flow:
   prompt| - `p` / `projects` - list directories with local Codex history
   prompt| - `p 1` / `project 1` / `1` - open workspace 1 from the `projects` list
   prompt| - `new` / `n` - create a Work chat in the currently opened workspace
   prompt| - `n <directory>` / `new <directory>` - create the directory if missing, then create a Work chat there
   prompt|
   prompt| History flow:
   prompt| - `s` / `sessions` / `history` - list local sessions in the selected workspace
   prompt| - `c 1` / `continue 1` / `1` on a sessions page - create/open a Work chat and import that session history
   prompt|
   prompt| Other control commands:
   prompt| - `st` / `status` - list active Teams work chats
   prompt| - `d <number>` / `details <number>` - show technical IDs and details
   prompt| - `park <session-number-or-id>` / `resume <session-number-or-id>` / `unpark <session-number-or-id>` - manually pause or resume polling for a Work chat
   prompt| - `fork <session>` - copy a session into a new Work chat
   prompt| - `m <directory>` / `mkdir <directory>` - create a directory only
   prompt| - `ask <question>` - ask a quick helper question in this control chat
   prompt| - `helper cancel last` / `helper cancel queued` / `helper cancel running` / `helper cancel all` - stop queued/running Codex question(s) in this Control chat
   prompt| - `model status|list|switch|reset` and `effort status|list|set|reset` - inspect or change only this Control chat (`model use` aliases switch)
   prompt| - Control-only `default model ...` / `default effort ...` manage future global defaults
   prompt| - `helper rename <title>` - rename this Control chat
   prompt| - `helper rename hostname <name>` - rename this machine in the Control chat and all linked Work chats
   prompt| - `h` / `help` / `menu` - show short help
   prompt| - `helper restart` - show the safe restart confirmation
   prompt| - `helper restart now` - restart the local Teams helper after sending a confirmation
   prompt| - `shutdown` - stop the helper on all machines until `cxp teams start` is run on a machine
   prompt| - `helper update now` - update to the latest stable helper release
   prompt| - `helper update prerelease` - update to the newest helper release or pre-release
   prompt| - `codex update now` - wait for active work, then update the local Codex CLI
   prompt| - `helper webhook setup` - show a guided Workflow webhook setup flow
   prompt| - `helper webhook <url>` - enable Workflow notification cards with a Teams Workflow webhook URL
   prompt| - `helper webhook off` - disable Workflow notification cards
   prompt| - `helper skills list|add|sync|push` - manage skill subscriptions
   prompt|
